==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
No [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies are present here, so its a lot easier than previous stages.

Use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to hold off the peons as you build your money. When Shy Boy spawns, use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to deal heavy damage, while using your tanky attackers (e.g. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]]) to deal some quick damage.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Almost the same, but the added Bore can be quite the pain if your cats aren't strong enough, so it is wise to bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats to [[Slow|slow]] or even stop its progress. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is a big help on this stage, since a majority of the enemies here are Red, and you should have him at a high level anyways. If one still struggles, bringing more anti-red attackers such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]]'s Normal and Crazed variants.

